---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import '../styles/globals.css'
---

<Base
  title="Laso — Your Health, Understood"
  description="Your Apple Watch collects 50+ health metrics. Laso reads them together so you actually know what's going on. Join the early access."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">

    <!-- ════════ NAV ════════ -->
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="nav-blur fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 border-b border-gray-100/60">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 h-12 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="#" class="text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark">Laso</a>
        <a href="#early-access" class="bg-apple-dark text-white text-xs font-medium rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 hover:bg-black transition-colors">
          Get Early Access
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ════════ HERO ════════ -->
    <section data-section="hero" class="hero-gradient pt-32 pb-16 md:pt-44 md:pb-24 px-5 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-apple-blue/10 text-apple-blue text-sm font-medium rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-apple-blue rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
        Early Access &mdash; Now Open
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-[1.08]">
        Your watch collects the data.<br/>
        <span class="gradient-text">We connect the dots.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg md:text-xl text-apple-secondary max-w-xl mx-auto text-balance leading-relaxed">
        50+ health metrics. One clear picture. Laso reads your Apple Watch data together so you know if you're actually doing okay.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-md mx-auto">
        <form id="hero-form" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <input
            type="email"
            placeholder="your@email.com"
            required
            class="hero-email-input flex-1 rounded-full border border-gray-200 px-5 py-3 text-[15px] text-apple-dark placeholder:text-apple-secondary/50 focus:outline-none focus:border-apple-blue focus:ring-1 focus:ring-apple-blue/30 transition-colors"
          />
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="bg-apple-dark text-white font-medium rounded-full px-7 py-3 text-[15px] hover:bg-black transition-colors active:scale-[0.97] cursor-pointer shrink-0"
          >
            Join Early Access
          </button>
        </form>
        <p class="hero-success mt-3 text-sm text-emerald-600 font-medium hidden">You're in! We'll be in touch soon.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[13px] text-apple-secondary/60">Free to join. No spam. We'll notify you when it's ready.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ THE GAP ════════ -->
    <section data-section="problem" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance">
          Your watch tracks everything.<br/>But what does it actually mean?
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-6 text-[15px] md:text-base text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Apple Health shows each metric in isolation &mdash; a number here, a chart there. You're left wondering: am I doing okay? Is this normal for me?
        </p>
        <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">50+</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">metrics collected daily</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center" style="transition-delay:80ms">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">0</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">apps that connect them</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center" style="transition-delay:160ms">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">?</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">"Am I actually healthy?"</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ WHAT LASO DOES (3 core values) ════════ -->
    <section data-section="solution" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          Laso gives you the answer, not more data.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-lg mx-auto">
          Open the app, glance, understand. Two minutes every morning.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v2.25m6.364.386-1.591 1.591M21 12h-2.25m-.386 6.364-1.591-1.591M12 18.75V21m-4.773-4.227-1.591 1.591M5.25 12H3m4.227-4.773L5.636 5.636M15.75 12a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Your daily health score</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">One number from 0&ndash;100, built from all your Apple Watch data across 7 categories. Adapts to your personal baselines, not population averages. Open the app &mdash; instantly know where you stand.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center" style="transition-delay:100ms">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-pink-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Early warnings, not noise</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Laso flags when multiple metrics shift together &mdash; like HRV dropping while resting heart rate rises. Catches patterns weeks before you'd notice them yourself.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center" style="transition-delay:200ms">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-green-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 0 1 0-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178Z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Your trends, your history</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Track how your health changes over weeks, months, and years. Year-over-year comparisons, seasonal patterns, baseline drift &mdash; all compared against your own data, not generic benchmarks.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ DEVICE SUPPORT ════════ -->
    <section data-section="devices" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance">
          Works with 16+ wearables. Not just Apple Watch.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-[15px] md:text-base text-apple-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Laso reads from any device that syncs to Apple Health. Wear what you want &mdash; we'll read the data.
        </p>

        <!-- Primary: Apple -->
        <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-center gap-4 min-w-[200px]">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600">
                <rect x="6" y="2" width="12" height="20" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <rect x="8" y="5" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                <path d="M9 1v1M15 1v1M9 22v1M15 22v1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="text-left">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-apple-dark">Apple Watch</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-apple-secondary">All metrics &middot; Full support</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-center gap-4 min-w-[200px]" style="transition-delay:60ms">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600">
                <rect x="5" y="1" width="14" height="22" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M10 19h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="text-left">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-apple-dark">iPhone</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-apple-secondary">Steps, distance, speed &middot; iOS 17+</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Full support devices -->
        <div class="mt-6">
          <p class="section-reveal text-xs font-medium text-apple-secondary/70 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Full metric support &middot; HRV, sleep stages &amp; more</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full"></span> Garmin
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:30ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full"></span> Oura Ring
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:60ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-orange-500 rounded-full"></span> Whoop
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:90ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span> Withings
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:120ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full"></span> Polar
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:150ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></span> COROS
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:180ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full"></span> Suunto
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:210ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-red-400 rounded-full"></span> Huawei Watch
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mid-tier support devices -->
        <div class="mt-5">
          <p class="section-reveal text-xs font-medium text-apple-secondary/70 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Sleep stages &amp; activity tracking</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-teal-500 rounded-full"></span> Fitbit
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:30ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full"></span> Samsung Galaxy Watch
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:60ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full"></span> Amazfit
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:90ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-orange-500 rounded-full"></span> Xiaomi Smart Band
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:120ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span> Google Pixel Watch
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Basic support devices -->
        <div class="mt-5">
          <p class="section-reveal text-xs font-medium text-apple-secondary/70 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Heart rate, steps &amp; basics</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-red-400 rounded-full"></span> Noise
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:30ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-red-400 rounded-full"></span> boAt
            </span>
            <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:60ms">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-orange-400 rounded-full"></span> Fire-Boltt
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="section-reveal mt-8 text-[13px] text-apple-secondary/60">Any device that writes to Apple Health works with Laso. Sync via companion app &mdash; Laso handles the rest.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ SCORE SHOWCASE ════════ -->
    <section data-section="score" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance">
          One score. Built from your data.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-lg mx-auto">
          Not a generic formula. It learns your baselines and adapts to your body &mdash; so you see what matters for you.
        </p>

        <!-- Score ring -->
        <div class="mt-14 flex justify-center">
          <div class="score-showcase">
            <div class="score-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="relative w-44 h-44 sm:w-56 sm:h-56 md:w-64 md:h-64 mx-auto">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 280 280" class="w-full h-full" aria-hidden="true">
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="ring-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0071e3"/>
                    <stop offset="40%" stop-color="#34d399"/>
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#06b6d4"/>
                  </linearGradient>
                  <filter id="ring-glow">
                    <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="6" result="blur"/>
                    <feMerge><feMergeNode in="blur"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge>
                  </filter>
                </defs>
                <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="120" fill="none" stroke="#e8e8ed" stroke-width="12"/>
                <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="120" fill="none" stroke="url(#ring-grad)" stroke-width="12"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-dasharray="753.98"
                  stroke-dashoffset="98"
                  filter="url(#ring-glow)"
                  class="origin-center -rotate-90 score-ring-animate"/>
              </svg>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                <span class="score-counter text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-apple-dark" data-target="87">0</span>
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-apple-secondary mt-1">out of 100</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Categories -->
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-red-500 rounded-full"></span> Heart
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:40ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full"></span> Sleep
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:80ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span> Activity
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:120ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-orange-500 rounded-full"></span> Body
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:160ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full"></span> Respiratory
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:200ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-purple-500 rounded-full"></span> Mindfulness
          </span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:240ms">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-teal-500 rounded-full"></span> Mobility
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="section-reveal mt-6 text-xs text-apple-secondary/60">Sample data &mdash; your score is calculated from your own metrics</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ DEEP FEATURES ════════ -->
    <section data-section="features" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          10 analysis engines running on every data point.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Not just charts. Laso runs correlation analysis, anomaly detection, pattern recognition, and trend tracking across all your metrics simultaneously.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
          <!-- Correlations -->
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.5 14.25v2.25m3-4.5v4.5m3-6.75v6.75m3-9v9M6 20.25h12A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 20.25 18V6A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18 3.75H6A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3.75 6v12A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 6 20.25Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Cross-Metric Correlations</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Finds real connections between 35+ metric pairs. Like how your sleep quality affects next-day resting heart rate.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Anomaly Detection -->
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all" style="transition-delay:60ms">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Anomaly Detection</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Flags when a metric goes outside your personal normal. Not population averages &mdash; your own baseline.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Recovery Analysis -->
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all" style="transition-delay:120ms">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-5 h-5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Recovery Tracking</h3>
